{"id":"n63179-2-9","stage":5,"title":"선행 · 先行","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63179-2-9-1","ko":"작업을 하는데 뭔가 잘못된 거 같아.","zh":"我正在干活，感觉好像出错了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"작업을","meaning":"作业，操作","explanation":"작업：作业，操作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"작업","audio":"/audio/01dfd369cfa718dda5f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24810","senseId":"2","lemma":"작업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"작업을","audio":"/audio/5dc744716a7566a82153.mp3"}},{"text":"하는데","meaning":"以某种方式构成行为。","explanation":"하다：以某种方式构成行为。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"25","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는데","audio":"/audio/f78512dad8d31fc58a77.mp3"}},{"text":"뭔가","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭔가","audio":"/audio/7f3853a0ea8084aa255c.mp3"}},{"text":"잘못된","meaning":"出错，失败","explanation":"잘못되다：出错，失败；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"잘못되다","audio":"/audio/907b4e753781c8cdeb77.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91481","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘못된","audio":"/audio/c38d87e9f4b5b2d0e3ef.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"01dfd369cfa718dd","term":"작업","zh":"作业，操作","audio":"/audio/01dfd369cfa718dda5f1.mp3","entryId":"24810","definition":"按一定目的和计划做的事情。","pronunciation":["자겁"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"以某种方式构成行为。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"以某种方式构成行为。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"907b4e753781c8cd","term":"잘못되다","zh":"出错，失败","audio":"/audio/907b4e753781c8cdeb77.mp3","entryId":"91481","definition":"事情错误或失败。","pronunciation":["잘몯뙤다","잘몯뛔다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相似，如同，像","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"互相差不多。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4b81be1fd8836b106e28.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63179-2-9-2","ko":"선행 작업에 문제가 있었던 거 아닐까?","zh":"是不是之前的准备工作出了问题？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"선행","meaning":"先行","explanation":"선행：先行","readings":[{"term":"선행","audio":"/audio/969e720561741ed89ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63179","senseId":"2","lemma":"선행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선행","audio":"/audio/969e720561741ed89ccd.mp3"}},{"text":"작업에","meaning":"作业，操作","explanation":"작업：作业，操作；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"작업","audio":"/audio/01dfd369cfa718dda5f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24810","senseId":"2","lemma":"작업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"작업에","audio":"/audio/7744ae00a6907381709e.mp3"